    "text_content": "4. Occupational Permit\nOccupational Permit is issued to any worker or employee who is not a holder of a validly \nissued Professional Tax Receipts, whether working on temporary and permanent basis. \nOccupational Permit is renewed annually on or before January 31. Late renewal is \nimposed a penalty of 25%. \nOffice or Division \nCity Mayor's Office – Permits & Licenses Division\nClassification \nSimple\nType of Transaction \nG2C – Government to Citizen\nWho may avail\nAny employee or worker who is a Filipino citizen",
